Step 7: Jenkins Pipeline

Jenkinsfile


pipeline {
    agent any

    stages {

        stage('Git Checkout') {
            steps {
                git 'https://github.com/user/employee-app.git'
            }
        }

        stage('Build') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn clean package'
            }
        }

        stage('Docker Build') {
            steps {
                sh 'docker build -t employee-app:v1 .'
            }
        }

        stage('Docker Push') {
            steps {
                sh 'docker push employee-app:v1'
            }
        }
    }
}

Step 8: ArgoCD GitOps

Store Helm chart in GitHub:

Plain Text
helm/employee-app

Create application:

Shell
argocd app create employee-app \
--repo https://github.com/user/employee-app.git \
--path helm/employee-app \
--dest-server https://kubernetes.default.svc \
--dest-namespace default

Sync:

Shell
argocd app sync employee-app
